{% doc %}
  Urun Karsilastirma blogu - Apple stili.

  Iki sutun yan yana durur (mobilde de). Her sutunda gorsel karti, urun
  adi ve alt alta ozellik kartlari bulunur. En altta iki dugme.

  Bu dosya daha once yapay zeka tarafindan uretilmisti; tasarim elden
  gecirildi ama BUTUN ayar kimlikleri korundu, dolayisiyla girilmis
  icerik ve renkler kaybolmaz.

  Iki yeni anahtar ayar:
  - "palet": Apple (koyu/acik) secilince asagidaki renk seciciler devre
    disi kalir. "Ozel" secilince bolumun onceki renkleri aynen doner.
  - "tipografi": "Site" secilince basliklar anasayfadaki olculere
    (24/28/32) oturur. "Ozel" secilince kayitli punto ayarlari kullanilir.
{% enddoc %}

{% liquid
  assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase
  assign s = block.settings

  comment
    --- renk katmani ---
  endcomment
  assign c_zemin = s.section_background
  assign c_etiket = s.category_color
  assign c_bas = s.title_color
  assign c_alt = s.subtitle_color
  assign c_urun_bas = s.product_title_color
  assign c_gorsel_kart = s.image_card_background
  assign c_gorsel_zemin = s.image_background
  assign c_kart = s.feature_card_background
  assign c_kart_kenar = s.feature_card_border_color
  assign c_kart_yazi = s.feature_text_color
  assign c_dugme = s.button_background
  assign c_dugme_yazi = s.button_text_color
  assign c_dugme_kenar = s.button_border_color
  assign c_dugme_h = s.button_hover_background
  assign c_dugme_h_yazi = s.button_hover_text_color
  assign c_dugme_h_kenar = s.button_hover_border_color
  assign kart_kenar_kalinlik = s.feature_card_border_width

  if s.palet == 'apple_koyu'
    assign c_zemin = '#000000'
    assign c_etiket = '#8a8a85'
    assign c_bas = '#ffffff'
    assign c_alt = '#a3a39e'
    assign c_urun_bas = '#ffffff'
    assign c_gorsel_kart = '#141414'
    assign c_gorsel_zemin = '#141414'
    assign c_kart = '#141414'
    assign c_kart_kenar = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10)'
    assign c_kart_yazi = '#ffffff'
    assign c_dugme = '#ffffff'
    assign c_dugme_yazi = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_dugme_kenar = '#ffffff'
    assign c_dugme_h = '#f4f4f4'
    assign c_dugme_h_yazi = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_dugme_h_kenar = '#f4f4f4'
    assign kart_kenar_kalinlik = 1
  elsif s.palet == 'apple_acik'
    assign c_zemin = '#f4f4f4'
    assign c_etiket = '#5c5c57'
    assign c_bas = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_alt = '#5c5c57'
    assign c_urun_bas = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_gorsel_kart = '#ffffff'
    assign c_gorsel_zemin = '#ffffff'
    assign c_kart = '#ffffff'
    assign c_kart_kenar = '#d2d2cd'
    assign c_kart_yazi = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_dugme = '#ffffff'
    assign c_dugme_yazi = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_dugme_kenar = '#d2d2cd'
    assign c_dugme_h = '#f4f4f4'
    assign c_dugme_h_yazi = '#0a0a0a'
    assign c_dugme_h_kenar = '#d2d2cd'
    assign kart_kenar_kalinlik = 1
  endif

  comment
    Hazir palet dugme renklerini de belirliyor. "Dugme renklerini kendim
    secegim" isaretliyse paletin uzerine yeniden ayardaki renkler yazilir.
    Varsayilan kapali; bu blogu kullanan diger sablonlar etkilenmez.
  endcomment
  if s.dugme_ozel
    assign c_dugme = s.button_background
    assign c_dugme_yazi = s.button_text_color
    assign c_dugme_kenar = s.button_border_color
    assign c_dugme_h = s.button_hover_background
    assign c_dugme_h_yazi = s.button_hover_text_color
    assign c_dugme_h_kenar = s.button_hover_border_color
  endif

  comment
    --- tipografi katmani ---
    "Site" modunda anasayfadaki olculer kullanilir: baslik 24/28/32,
    satir araligi 1.15, kalinlik 700; govde 16/20, satir araligi 1.6.
  endcomment
  assign f_etiket_m = s.category_size_mobile
  assign f_etiket_d = s.category_size_desktop
  assign f_bas_m = s.title_size_mobile
  assign f_bas_t = s.title_size_desktop
  assign f_bas_d = s.title_size_desktop
  assign f_alt_m = s.subtitle_size_mobile
  assign f_alt_d = s.subtitle_size_desktop
  assign f_urun_m = s.product_title_size_mobile
  assign f_urun_d = s.product_title_size_desktop
  assign f_kart_m = s.feature_text_size_mobile
  assign f_kart_d = s.feature_text_size_desktop
  assign f_dugme_m = s.button_text_size_mobile
  assign f_dugme_d = s.button_text_size_desktop

  if s.tipografi == 'site'
    assign f_etiket_m = 12
    assign f_etiket_d = 13
    assign f_bas_m = 24
    assign f_bas_t = 28
    assign f_bas_d = 32
    assign f_alt_m = 16
    assign f_alt_d = 20
    assign f_urun_m = 18
    assign f_urun_d = 22
    assign f_kart_m = 15
    assign f_kart_d = 16
    assign f_dugme_m = 15
    assign f_dugme_d = 16
  endif

  comment
    "Site" tipografisi dugme yazi olcusunu de sabitliyor. "Dugme yazi
    boyutunu kendim secegim" isaretliyse tipografinin uzerine yeniden
    ayardaki olculer yazilir; gerisi site olcusunde kalir. Varsayilan
    kapali oldugu icin bu blogu kullanan diger sablonlar etkilenmez.
  endcomment
  if s.dugme_yazi_ozel
    assign f_dugme_m = s.button_text_size_mobile
    assign f_dugme_d = s.button_text_size_desktop
  endif

  comment
    Masaustu dugme yuksekligi. 0 = ayri bir deger yok, mobil olcusu
    gecerli. Kompakt moddaki vh katsayisi da hedef yukseklige gore
    olcekleniyor; 48px'te katsayi 5.2 kalir, yani eski davranis aynen
    korunur.
  endcomment
  assign dugme_yuk_d = s.button_height
  if s.button_height_d > 0
    assign dugme_yuk_d = s.button_height_d
  endif
  assign dugme_vh = dugme_yuk_d | times: 5.2 | divided_by: 48.0 | round: 2

  assign kart_kalinlik = 400
  if s.feature_text_weight == 'orta'
    assign kart_kalinlik = 500
  elsif s.feature_text_weight == 'kalin'
    assign kart_kalinlik = 600
  endif
%}

{% style %}
  .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ c_zemin }};
    padding: {{ s.section_padding_mobile }}px {{ s.kenar_m }}px;
  }
  .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .ai-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ s.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* --- baslik --- */
  .ai-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ s.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ f_etiket_m }}px;
    color: {{ c_etiket }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-comparison-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ f_bas_m }}px;
    color: {{ c_bas }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = f_bas_m -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .ai-comparison-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ f_alt_m }}px;
    color: {{ c_alt }};
    margin: 14px auto 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* --- urun sutunlari --- */
  .ai-comparison-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ s.column_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ s.features_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-comparison-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ s.image_card_size }}px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ s.image_spacing }}px;
    border-radius: {{ s.image_card_radius }}px;
    background-color: {{ c_gorsel_kart }};
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: {{ s.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Kare oran: iki sutunun gorselleri her zaman ayni yukseklikte olur,
     boylece urun adlari da ayni hizada durur. */
  .ai-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: {{ s.image_fit }};
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-comparison-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background-color: {{ c_gorsel_zemin }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ s.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 50%;
    height: 50%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-comparison-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: none; }
  .ai-comparison-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; }

  .ai-comparison-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ f_urun_m }}px;
    color: {{ c_urun_bas }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = f_urun_m -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  /* --- ozellik kartlari --- */
  .ai-comparison-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ s.feature_card_spacing }}px;
  }

  /* Satirdaki iki kart grid sayesinde kendiliginden esit yukseklikte
     olur; eskiden bunu JS ile olcup yaziyorduk, gereksizdi. */
  .ai-comparison-feature-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ s.column_gap }}px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .ai-comparison-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ c_kart }};
    border: {{ kart_kenar_kalinlik }}px solid {{ c_kart_kenar }};
    border-radius: {{ s.feature_card_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ s.feature_card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-comparison-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ f_kart_m }}px;
    color: {{ c_kart_yazi }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: {{ kart_kalinlik }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* --- dugmeler --- */
  .ai-comparison-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ s.column_gap }}px;
    margin-top: {{ s.button_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: {{ s.button_width }}%;
    min-height: {{ s.button_height }}px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    background-color: {{ c_dugme }};
    color: {{ c_dugme_yazi }};
    border: {{ s.button_border_width }}px solid {{ c_dugme_kenar }};
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: {{ f_dugme_m }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease,
      border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      background-color: {{ c_dugme_h }};
      color: {{ c_dugme_h_yazi }};
      border-color: {{ c_dugme_h_kenar }};
    }
    {%- comment -%}
      Hover zemininde degrade (istege bagli). Varsayilan kapali: bu blok
      baska sablonlarda da kullaniliyor, kapaliyken cikti aynen eskisi gibi.
      background-color yukarida kisayolla degil dogrudan verildigi icin
      buradaki background-image onu silmiyor, uzerine biniyor.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.settings.hover_degrade %}
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      background-image: linear-gradient({{ block.settings.hover_aci }}deg, {{ block.settings.hover_d1 }} 0%, {{ block.settings.hover_d2 }} 50%, {{ block.settings.hover_d3 }} 100%);
      background-size: 100% 100%;
    }
    {%- endif %}
  }
  .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
  .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid {{ c_bas }};
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* --- ikiye bolunen dugme --- */
  /* Baslangicta secenekler acik, tetik gizli: JS calismazsa ziyaretci
     iki baglantiyi da dogrudan gorur. JS "ai-bol-hazir" ekleyince
     durum tersine doner. */
  .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }} { min-width: 0; }

  .ai-btn-tetik-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: none; }

  .ai-bol-secenekler-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(6px, 2vw, 10px);
  }

  .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-bol-hazir .ai-btn-tetik-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
  }
  .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-bol-hazir .ai-bol-secenekler-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }
  .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-bol-hazir.is-bolundu .ai-btn-tetik-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }
  .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-bol-hazir.is-bolundu .ai-bol-secenekler-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    animation: ai-bol-{{ ai_gen_id }} 240ms cubic-bezier(.33, 1, .68, 1) both;
  }

  @keyframes ai-bol-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-btn-yuva-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-bol-hazir.is-bolundu .ai-bol-secenekler-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .ai-kucuk-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 6px 8px;
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }

  {% if s.anim_ac %}
  /* --- kaydirinca sirayla belirme --- */
  /* Gizli baslangic durumu yalnizca JS "ai-hazir" sinifini ekledikten
     sonra gecerli; JS calismazsa icerik oldugu gibi gorunur kalir. */
  .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-hazir [data-ai-anim] {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, {{ s.anim_mesafe }}px, 0);
    transition:
      opacity {{ s.anim_sure }}ms cubic-bezier(.33, 1, .68, 1),
      transform {{ s.anim_sure }}ms cubic-bezier(.33, 1, .68, 1);
    transition-delay: var(--ai-gecikme, 0ms);
    will-change: opacity, transform;
  }
  .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-hazir [data-ai-anim].is-gorunur {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }
  .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} [data-ai-anim].anim-bitti {
    will-change: auto;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-hazir [data-ai-anim],
    .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-hazir [data-ai-anim].is-gorunur {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
  {% endif %}

  /* --- tablet --- */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ s.section_padding_desktop }}px {{ s.kenar_d }}px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_etiket_d }}px; }
    .ai-comparison-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_bas_t }}px; }
    .ai-comparison-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_alt_d }}px; }
    .ai-comparison-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; }
    .ai-comparison-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: none; }
    .ai-comparison-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_urun_d }}px; }
    .ai-comparison-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_kart_d }}px; }
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_dugme_d }}px; }
  }

  /* --- masaustu --- */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-comparison-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ f_bas_d }}px; }

    /* Masaustunde sutunlar arasi daha genis, gorseller daha buyuk:
       genis ekranda ayni olculer bolumu seyrek gosteriyordu. */
    .ai-comparison-products-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-comparison-feature-row-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-comparison-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ s.column_gap_d }}px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: {{ s.image_card_size_d }}px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ s.feature_card_padding_d }}px;
    }
    {%- unless s.dugme_genis_d %}
    .ai-comparison-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: {{ s.dugme_max_g }}px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    {%- endunless %}
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} { min-height: {{ dugme_yuk_d }}px; }
  }

  {% if s.kompakt %}
  /* ================= TEK EKRANA SIGDIRMA =================
     Karsilastirmanin tamami tek ekranda gorulebilsin diye butun
     olculer ekran genisligine gore olceklenir (clamp). Kayitli px
     ayarlari bu modda devre disi kalir; kapatinca aynen geri doner.
     Satir sayisi ve metin uzunlugu yuksekligi belirledigi icin
     asagidaki degerler 5 satirlik bir karsilastirmaya gore secildi. */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: clamp(18px, 5vw, 40px) clamp(12px, 4vw, 20px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 3.5vw, 24px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: clamp(10px, 2.8vw, 12px);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    /* Baslik ve alt metne dokunmuyoruz: anasayfayla ayni olcude
       kalmalilar (24 px baslik, 16 px govde, satir araligi 1.6).
       Kazanilacak yer kartlardan ve bosluklardan cikariliyor. */
    .ai-comparison-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: clamp(8px, 3vw, 14px);
      margin-bottom: clamp(10px, 3vw, 18px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: min(120px, 30vw);
      margin-bottom: clamp(6px, 1.8vw, 10px);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} { border-radius: 14px; }
    .ai-comparison-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: clamp(13px, 3.8vw, 17px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: clamp(5px, 1.6vw, 9px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-feature-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: clamp(8px, 3vw, 14px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: clamp(7px, 2.3vw, 13px);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-feature-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: clamp(11px, 3.1vw, 14px);
      line-height: 1.32;
    }
    .ai-comparison-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: clamp(8px, 3vw, 14px);
      margin-top: clamp(10px, 3vw, 18px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: clamp(34px, 9.5vw, 44px);
      font-size: clamp(12px, 3.3vw, 15px);
      padding: 6px 10px;
    }
    {% if s.alt_gizle_m %}
    /* Son 40-50 pikseli de kazanmak icin alt metin mobilde gizlenir */
    .ai-comparison-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: none; }
    {% endif %}
  }

  /* Masaustunde olculeri ekran GENISLIGINE degil YUKSEKLIGINE bagliyoruz:
     tek ekrana sigma sorunu bir yukseklik sorunu. Alcak bir tarayici
     penceresinde gorsel ve bosluklar kendiliginden kuculur. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: clamp(20px, 3.5vh, 48px) {{ s.kenar_d }}px;
    }
    .ai-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 2vh, 26px); }
    .ai-comparison-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin-top: 10px; }
    .ai-comparison-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin-bottom: clamp(12px, 2vh, 26px); }
    .ai-comparison-product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: min({{ s.image_card_size_d }}px, 19vh);
      margin-bottom: clamp(6px, 1.2vh, 14px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} { gap: clamp(6px, 1vh, 12px); }
    .ai-comparison-feature-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: clamp(10px, 1.7vh, {{ s.feature_card_padding_d }}px);
    }
    .ai-comparison-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin-top: clamp(12px, 2vh, 26px); }
    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: clamp(38px, {{ dugme_vh }}vh, {{ dugme_yuk_d }}px);
    }
  }
  {% endif %}

  {%- comment -%}
    Iki dugmeye ayri ayri degrade (istege bagli, varsayilan kapali).
    Bu blok baska sablonlarda da kullaniliyor; kapaliyken tek bir
    kural bile basilmiyor, cikti eskisiyle birebir ayni kaliyor.

    Kurallar bilerek stil blogunun en sonunda: hover kurallariyla
    ozgulluk esit (0,2,0) oldugu icin kaynak sirasi belirliyor ve
    dugmeye ozel degrade genel hover degradesinin onune geciyor.
    Uzerine gelince degrade degismiyor, sadece hafifce parlıyor --
    yoksa background-color degisimi degradenin altinda kalacagi icin
    dugme hicbir tepki vermemis gibi gorunurdu.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if s.gift_deg %}
  .ai-btn-hediye-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-btn-hediye-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-image: linear-gradient({{ s.gift_aci }}deg, {{ s.gift_d1 }} 0%, {{ s.gift_d2 }} 50%, {{ s.gift_d3 }} 100%);
    background-size: 100% 100%;
    border-color: transparent;
    color: {{ s.gift_yazi }};
  }
  .ai-btn-hediye-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transition: filter 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  }
  .ai-btn-hediye-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible { outline-color: {{ c_bas }}; }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .ai-btn-hediye-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
  }
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if s.couple_deg %}
  .ai-btn-couple-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-btn-couple-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-image: linear-gradient({{ s.couple_aci }}deg, {{ s.couple_d1 }} 0%, {{ s.couple_d2 }} 50%, {{ s.couple_d3 }} 100%);
    background-size: 100% 100%;
    border-color: transparent;
    color: {{ s.couple_yazi }};
  }
  .ai-btn-couple-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transition: filter 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  }
  .ai-btn-couple-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus-visible { outline-color: {{ c_bas }}; }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .ai-btn-couple-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
  }
  {%- endif %}
